{"seq":3,"slug":"marine-geology-chemistry","title":"海洋地质与化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"seafloor-geology","title":"海底地质学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/seafloor-geology","wordCount":1899,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"marine-geochemistry","title":"海洋地球化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/marine-geochemistry","wordCount":2067,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"marine-sedimentology","title":"海洋沉积学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/marine-sedimentology","wordCount":1970,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"海洋地质与化学-简介\">海洋地质与化学 简介</h1><p>海洋地质与化学从地球科学视角研究海底固体地球过程和海水化学体系，是理解地球系统演化不可或缺的学科方向。本章涵盖海底地质构造、海洋化学过程和沉积记录三大主题，揭示海洋-岩石圈-大气圈之间的物质循环与能量交换。</p>\n<p>本章包含三个专题：</p>\n<p><strong>海底地质学</strong>以板块构造理论为框架，系统阐述海底地形地貌的形成机制。从大洋中脊的海底扩张到俯冲带的地震活动，从转换断层到热点火山链，从被动大陆边缘到主动大陆边缘，构建海底构造演化的完整图景。重点介绍热液喷口系统的地质-化学-生物耦合过程，以及深海矿产资源（多金属结核、富钴结壳、块状硫化物）的分布规律与成矿机制。</p>\n<p><strong>海洋地球化学</strong>研究海水中化学元素和化合物的来源、分布、迁移转化与归宿。以海洋碳循环为主线，阐述有机碳泵和碳酸盐泵的运作机制；分析营养盐（氮、磷、硅）的生物地球化学循环及其对初级生产力的限制；介绍稳定同位素（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^{13}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>C、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>O）和放射性同位素（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{14}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>C、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>230</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{230}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">230</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>Th）在海洋过程示踪中的应用。</p>\n<p><strong>海洋沉积学</strong>关注海洋沉积物的来源、搬运、沉积和成岩过程。从河流输入、风尘沉降到生物沉降的各种物源机制，从陆架到深海的沉积物分布模式，到深海钻探（ODP/IODP）获取的沉积岩芯记录解读。重点讲解沉积物作为古气候—古海洋代用指标的原理与方法，以及浊流、等深流等深海沉积过程。</p>\n<p>学习建议：本章需要地质学概论和基础化学的预备知识。建议结合岩石矿物鉴定实验、地球化学分析实验和海底地形图判读练习来巩固理论认识。</p>\n"}